WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:04.137
♪♪♪
&gt;&gt; HONEY, WE JUST GOT AN ALERT.

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:06.139 align:start size:94% position:6%
THERE'S SOME WEIRD CHARGES ON
THE DISCOVER CARD.

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:08.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'LL CALL THEM.
&gt;&gt; GOOD LUCK.

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:10.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
YOU'LL JUST BE TALKING TO A
ROBOT.

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:13.346
&gt;&gt; NOPE, WITH THE DISCOVER CARD
YOU GET TO TALK TO A REAL PERSON

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:15.482 align:start size:94% position:6%
WHO'S JUST LIKE YOU.
[ PHONE RINGING ]

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:18.985 align:start size:94% position:6%
HELLO?
IS SOMEONE THERE?

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:26.059 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; DISCOVER-CARD.
&gt;&gt; HEY, GIRL.

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:27.127
THERE'S SOME WEIRD CHARGES ON MY
ACCOUNT.

00:00:27.127 --> 00:00:30.130 align:start size:94% position:6%
I THINK SOMEONE STOLE MY
IDENTITY.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:40.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I CAN HELP YOU WITH THAT.
&gt;&gt; OH, GIRL ARE YOU SICK?

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.541
ANYWAY, IT LOOKS LIKE SOMEONE
USED MY CAR TO BUY A BUNCH OF

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:42.942
RED JUMP SUITS, MOTORCYCLE
GLOVES, HUNDREDS OF RABBITS AND

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:44.010 size:75% position:38%
SOME GIANT SCISSORS.
&gt;&gt; THAT'S SO RANDOM.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.078 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OH, MY GOD.
I SAY RANDOM ALL THE TIME.

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:50.917 align:start size:94% position:6%
ARE YOU ME?
&gt;&gt; WHAT?

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:54.454
A LONG TIME --
&gt;&gt; SORRY, CAN WE SPEED THIS UP?

00:00:54.454 --> 00:01:00.727
MY FAMILY AND I ARE ON VACATION.
&gt;&gt; WHEN YOU GO ON VACATION, I

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:04.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
SIT IN A CAVE.
&gt;&gt; OH, THAT SOUNDS BAD.

00:01:04.264 --> 00:01:08.902
I WOULD I NOT SWITCH PLACES WITH
YOU.

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:18.244 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; BE CAREFUL.
&gt;&gt; HELLO?

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:19.446 align:start size:94% position:6%
BABE, I'M NOT GETTING ANYWHERE
WITH THIS WOMAN.

00:01:19.446 --> 00:01:21.181 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW WHAT?
I GOT THIS.

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:23.716 align:start size:94% position:6%
GIVE ME THE PHONE.
YEAH, IS THIS DISCOVER?

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:27.454 align:start size:94% position:6%
HEY, THAT'S WHY YOU HANDLE THE
MONEY.

